580	// QK and PV both run on the fp8 tensor core (2x bf16 throughput). The f32 accumulator layout for
581	// m64n128k32.e4m3 is identical to the bf16 m64n128k16 one, so softmax/mask/epilogue are unchanged.
582	// fp8 1-byte 128B swizzle: 128 fp8 = one 128B row; the 16-byte (16-fp8) chunk is swizzled by row&7.
583	// For hd128/CTA_N=128 every operand tile (Q,K,Vt,P) is a [128-row,128-col] K-major fp8 tile. The
